# Keep LF in the working tree on every platform.
#
# Biome formats with LF, so without this a checkout on Windows (where
# core.autocrlf defaults to true) rewrites every text file to CRLF and
# `npm run lint` fails on files nobody touched.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never convert.
*.webp binary
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
*.jpeg binary
*.gif  binary
*.ico  binary
*.woff binary
*.woff2 binary
*.pdf  binary
